From: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 12:38:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tests: associate the context example with Retry

RetryContext is not an exported function in the v3 API. Name this
example as a context variant of Retry so current Go vet accepts it.
The example body and cancellation behavior are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: cl2t <yihong.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
 example_test.go | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/example_test.go b/example_test.go
index 19d0451..404bc0c 100644
--- a/example_test.go
+++ b/example_test.go
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@ func ExampleRetry() {
 	// Operation is successful.
 }
 
-func ExampleRetryContext() { // nolint: govet
+func ExampleRetry_context() { // nolint: govet
 	// A context
 	ctx := context.Background()
 
